{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "story_skadi_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_skadi_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "不见尽头的旅途",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_skadi_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "d41ddb9419ef132bfb314b3bef6b5c66ecf4ff8be69bd92769756dd2f57afe04",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_ibbar"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谁是萝贝？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_462_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，是我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这是今天份的食物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_462_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，好的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还有，这是乔尼让我给你带的礼物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_462_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，这是我最喜欢的花！乔尼怎么不自己来？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他说他要工作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_462_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "胆小鬼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没事的话，我就走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_462_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎，哎，客人，等等。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他已经付钱了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_462_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不是，你是最近来到镇子里的赏金猎人斯卡蒂吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_462_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "听说你帮了大家不少忙，我一直想见见你呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没什么大不了的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_462_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "坐吧，斯卡蒂，我请你吃点什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......有酒吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_462_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "麦酒可以吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_462_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "给。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_462_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的口音真奇怪，斯卡蒂，你不是伊比利亚人吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_462_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真难得，我们这里经常有逃难的人经过，但是我从没见过不是伊比利亚人的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_462_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "客人，你从哪里来？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我从海里来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_462_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "海里？你是阿戈尔人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_462_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们村子里也有阿戈尔人，但我觉得他们和我没什么差别，不像你，我一看到就觉得和我们不一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_462_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我听他们说，他们都是爷爷辈的时候就离开了阿戈尔来到了陆地上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_462_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对了，我的邻居也是阿戈尔人，我去让她来和你聊聊吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她曾经抱有过这样的期待，但当她见到那些陆上的阿戈尔人时，她就知道，她和他们不一样。\n只有最年老的那些，还依稀记得阿戈尔的样貌。\n她没有能够与他们分享的东西，正如他们也一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_462_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_462_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎，斯卡蒂，你知道吗，村子里的人经常谈论你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_462_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你刚来到村子里的时候，大家都吓了一跳，我们都以为你是被其他赏金猎人打伤才逃到村子里来的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_462_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "受伤的赏金猎人，就像易怒的野兽，我们都很害怕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "陆地上的生物大多孱弱，无法伤害她。\n让她受伤的，是一些自称隶属深海教会的人。\n他们不知为何盯上了她，并且，他们明显和普通的伊比利亚人不一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_462_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但现在，他们都说，没见过你这么友善的赏金猎人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "赏金猎人，都很糟糕？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_462_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "之前也有一些赏金猎人流窜到我们村子里，他们都非常凶恶，经常和村子里的人起冲突。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_462_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以一开始大家还讨论过，要不要把你赶出去呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我会离开的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_462_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别呀，你这几天帮了村里人很多忙，他们现在都很喜欢你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_462_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你想在这座村子待多久都行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_462_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还是说，你有要去的地方吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_462_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸？那你是要回家吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_462_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，对不起，我明明知道有很多人是因为家乡被毁了而往外跑的，我真笨......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不是的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_462_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，或许你说得没错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_462_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咦，钟声怎么响了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_462_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这是村子里发生紧急情况时才会响起的钟声......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慌张的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_460_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "萝贝，萝贝！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_462_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "乔尼，你不是在工作吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慌张的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_460_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "快躲起来！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_462_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么了？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慌张的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_460_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有一群怪物靠近了村子，已经有人受伤了，我们要去拦住它们！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慌张的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_460_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你快去地窖里躲起来！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_462_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我、我知道了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慌张的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_460_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "斯卡蒂，你......你不是我们这里的人，快跑吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_462_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "斯卡蒂，你要是害怕的话，跟我来吧，我家的地窖可以藏许多人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "来到陆地上后，斯卡蒂一直有一种感觉。\n这种感觉随着这样的事情不断发生而逐渐变得强烈。\n但她始终不敢确信。\n她不敢确信，海怪们因她而来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "27_g16_lighthouse_street"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恐惧的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_461_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "噫，不要啊！！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海怪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_458_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慌张的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_460_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "快，躲到我背后！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恐惧的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_461_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这、这是什么怪物！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慌张的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_460_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我听说过，这是海里的怪物！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慌张的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_460_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "照理说，它们是爬不到我们这样内陆的地方的，为什么会出现在这里......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慌张的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_460_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且有这么多！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海怪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_458_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恐惧的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_461_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么办，它好像一点也没受伤啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慌张的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_460_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......它们的行动没有那么快，先走，去和其他人会合！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恐惧的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_461_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恐惧的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_461_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "噫！这边也有！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恐惧的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_461_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不要，不要过来！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慌张的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_460_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可恶，我和你拼了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慌张的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_460_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咕......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恐惧的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_461_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不要，不要啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海怪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_458_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海怪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_458_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慌张的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_460_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "居然只用一剑......斯卡蒂，你好厉害啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慌张的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_460_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你打算留下来帮我们吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慌张的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_460_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你真是个好家伙啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......跟我走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "当斯卡蒂在海滩睁开双眼的时候，她的身边没有任何人。\n阿戈尔，深海猎人，命悬一线的厮杀。\n这一切仿佛并不存在。\n只有海浪声与风声在她耳边作响。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "27_g16_lighthouse_street"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海怪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_458_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海怪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_458_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她无数次试图返回大海。\n但每一次的结果，都是被无数的海怪围住，不得不中途折返。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "27_g16_lighthouse_street"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "滚开。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "某个时刻，当她又一次不得不往回游时，她甚至感觉自己产生了错觉——\n那深海中一望无际的怪物们，不是在追逐她，而是在欢送她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "27_g16_lighthouse_street"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（阿戈尔语）为什么，要靠近我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "当她意识到，自己可能再也无法返回大海之后，她不得不在海岸上回头，她不得不踏上这片她从未关心过的大地。\n大地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "27_g16_lighthouse_street"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_462_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "斯卡蒂好厉害啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慌张的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_460_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "萝贝，你怎么跑出来了？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_462_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我担心斯卡蒂......而且，斯卡蒂都来帮我们了，难道我们的家园不应该由我们自己来保护吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慌张的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_460_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "说的是啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "勇敢的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_459_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "说得没错！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不需要帮忙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "在她看来，陆地上的人们大多就像眼前的这些人一样。\n孱弱，多愁善感，过着毫无效率与品质可言的生活。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_462_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别这么说，斯卡蒂，我们不能让你替我们扛下一切。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慌张的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_460_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我去帮斯卡蒂一把！虽然不知道能不能对这些怪物造成伤害，但是至少能帮她分散一些怪物的注意！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_462_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也来帮忙！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "勇敢的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_459_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大家跟斯卡蒂一起上！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（阿戈尔语）我说了，不要靠近我！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "但她不得不承认，她和陆地上的人之间，在情感上有着相通之处。\n她能够理解他们因为怎样的事而产生怎样的情感。\n也正因如此，她才愈发苦恼，并为此产生罪恶感。\n而她无法将这份情感宣泄给村民，只能加速挥舞手中的巨剑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慌张的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_460_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "斯卡蒂在说什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "勇敢的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_459_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你看她变得更快了，一定是在给我们加油吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慌张的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_460_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好嘞，瞧我的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海怪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_458_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慌张的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_460_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "给我滚出去，怪物们！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海怪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_458_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慌张的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_460_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "勇敢的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_459_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别怕，怪物，尝尝这个！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慌张的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_460_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谢了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "勇敢的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_459_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "都是朋友，应该的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海怪",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_458_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "勇敢的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_459_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它们怕了！大家加油，一起把怪物们赶出去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民们",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喔！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "27_g16_lighthouse_street"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_462_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "太好了！剩下的好像都跑了，村子周围已经看不到那些怪物的影子了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "勇敢的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_459_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿嘿，我们还挺厉害的嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_462_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你在那自豪个什么劲呢，要不是有斯卡蒂在，我们可能全都要完了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慌张的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_460_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，这家伙就这样，反正我们活下来了，就让他嘚瑟一下吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_462_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好吧好吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她也曾有可以一起战斗，并分享战斗喜悦的战友。\n他们中大多数都在那场战斗中死去。\n在过去，牺牲对她来说并不陌生。\n但当她看着村人们发自内心地分享喜悦时，她忽然产生了一个念头——\n她或许是最后一个深海猎人了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_462_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "斯卡蒂，你怎么了，你的脸色很不好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......没什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "勇敢的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_459_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我看啊，斯卡蒂一定是肚子饿了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慌张的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_460_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这么一说，我也有些饿了，哈哈！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_462_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别贫了。不过，斯卡蒂是今天的大功臣，我今晚一定会亲手做一顿大餐犒劳你的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_462_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且，斯卡蒂帮了我们这么大的忙，现在，村里人肯定不会反对让斯卡蒂成为我们的一员了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "勇敢的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_459_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我可是从一开始就不反对的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慌张的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_460_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也没意见！嘿嘿，斯卡蒂，你想在我们村子待多久就可以待多久，我说的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_462_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊，斯卡蒂，你这么厉害，你留下来我们也会安心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_462_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不是没有要去的地方吗，斯卡蒂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_462_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你可以和我一起生活。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，我在刚刚决定了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果我无法回到大海，那我就去没有水的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_county_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "健谈的赏金猎人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，你听说了斯卡蒂的事情没有？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好奇的赏金猎人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_008",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "斯卡蒂？我好像没听说过。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "健谈的赏金猎人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的消息不灵通啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好奇的赏金猎人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_008",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "行行行，我消息不灵通，赶紧说说。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "健谈的赏金猎人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "斯卡蒂是这阵子忽然冒出来的一个阿戈尔人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好奇的赏金猎人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_008",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿戈尔人？那是哪里人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "健谈的赏金猎人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你......算了，卡西米尔人不知道阿戈尔也不奇怪，我也不是很了解，反正你知道那是个国家就行了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好奇的赏金猎人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_008",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦......然后呢，这个斯卡蒂怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "健谈的赏金猎人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她拿着一把巨剑，穿得也很显眼，而且坚持当独行侠，一开始大家还以为她很快就会死在不知道什么地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "健谈的赏金猎人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "结果她不仅活得很好，而且抢了许多人的活。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好奇的赏金猎人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_008",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "健谈的赏金猎人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "上个月，“火肺”放出话要收拾她，你猜怎么着？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好奇的赏金猎人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_008",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "让她跑了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "健谈的赏金猎人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，她一个人就把“火肺”派来的队伍全给放倒了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好奇的赏金猎人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_008",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这......她到底是什么来头？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "健谈的赏金猎人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不知道，有消息说，她是跟着一群从伊比利亚回来的赏金猎人一起出现的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "健谈的赏金猎人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "反正据说“火肺”已经气炸了，我就等着看好戏了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉默的过路人",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "请问。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "健谈的赏金猎人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？你是谁？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉默的过路人",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我是谁并不重要，我只好奇，你刚才提到的这个阿戈尔人，她现在在哪？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
